{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/extras/e87a43727df3fe3320290593df1b6a9f.poster.avif?t=1760508213\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/extras/e87a43727df3fe3320290593df1b6a9f.webm?t=1760508213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive with your fluffy companions!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FuwaFuwa Survivors is a survivor-style action roguelite that mixes roguelike buildcraft with fast-paced combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control adorable animals and fight off swarming enemies in tight 15-minute runs, then take down powerful bosses. Level up during battle to evolve skills, combine them with the enchantment system, and forge your own unique builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Can Play on the Demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Playable Characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 <i>Distinctive\u00a0</i>Maps with Different Styles of Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Base Skills with Unique Evolve Options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Skill Enchantments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Types of Pets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.poster.avif?t=1760508213\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.webm?t=1760508213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/extras/eb76f2c15d3826990c9a919ed36869b6.mp4?t=1760508213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, horde-clearing combat: hundreds\u2014then thousands\u2014of enemies for pure mow-down fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildcraft depth: upgrade skills + evolve via enchantments to create distinct playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets in battle: bring personality-packed pets for damage, control, or support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression: spend coins between runs to strengthen characters and unlock new options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy the quick, build-focused loops of survivor/roguelite games, this one\u2019s for you\u2014and if you want extra cuteness, bring the pets along!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052210?t=1760508213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/1b4871d545fc7917cc106fb3a97f68a6eb30375b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760508213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/2521cb4970ae1042b8b370c4eef80239ca32c4d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760508213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052210/2521cb4970ae1042b8b370c4eef80239ca32c4d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760508213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"ano